<title>JAPAN: Nagano Japan Radio says offers dlr straight bond.</title>
<headline>Nagano Japan Radio says offers dlr straight bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following privately placed dollar straight bond issue was announced by borrower Nagano Japan Radio Co Ltd on Tuesday:</p>
<p> AMT		 $13.5 million</p>
<p> COUPON	    30 bps above six-month U.S. dollar LIBOR</p>
<p> MATURITY	  25 Feb 2002</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 100 pct</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  24 Feb 1997</p>
<p> SIGN DATE	 14 Feb 1997</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Hokuriku Finance (H.K.) Ltd</p>
<p> MANAGERS	  Mitsubishi Trust Finance (Asia) Ltd and</p>
<p>			Hachijuni Asia Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE: The straight bonds will be issued in Hong Kong and are guaranteed by Hokuriku Bank Ltd.</p>
</text>
